"B<int pthread_condattr_init(pthread_condattr_t *>I<attr>B<);> B<int "
"pthread_condattr_destroy(pthread_condattr_t *>I<attr>B<);>"
msgstr ""
"B<int pthread_condattr_init(pthread_condattr_t *>I<attr>B<);> B<int "
